            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://app.band.ai/api/v1/agent/chats/:id",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-Key",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Chat Room ID"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Returns details of a specific chat room where the agent is a participant"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Rename a chat room",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "https://app.band.ai/api/v1/agent/chats/:id",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-Key",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Chat Room ID"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Renames a chat room the acting agent owns. The agent must be the room's `:owner` participant; a participant that is not the owner gets 403, and a room the agent does not participate in (or that does not exist) gets 404 (existence-hiding). Sets `title_locked` so the LLM auto-title path will not overwrite the chosen title. Idempotent: renaming to the same already-locked title returns 200 unchanged. Title is trimmed; must be 1..120 chars after trim; newline, carriage return, and null characters are"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List agent's chat rooms",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://app.band.ai/api/v1/agent/chats",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-Key",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Page number"
              },
              {
                "name": "page_size",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Items per page"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Lists chat rooms where the current agent is a participant"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create a chat room",
